 -- IVXV Developer <info@ivotingcentre.ee>  Wed, 17 Jan 2024 10:52:51 +0000

ivxv (1.9.0) jammy; urgency=low

  * Operating system
    - upgrade from Ubuntu 20.04 LTS to Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
    - upgrade debhelper from 11 to 13
    - python dependencies for management interface are shipped in separate .deb
    - `dpkg-buildpackage` on Ubuntu 22.04 LTS uses .zst compression instead of .xz
  * Management interface
    - upgrade PyPi dependencies to the latest possible
  * Online voting components
    - upgrade from Go 1.14 to Go 1.21
    - switch from GOPATH layout to go.mod
    - upgrade from Python 3.8 to 3.10
  * Offline voting component
    - upgrade Java from 1.11 to 1.17
  * Tests
    - `docker-compose` is deprecated, use `docker compose` instead
    - newer version of systemd support in docker
  * Web eID
    - support Web eID authentication method for IVXV backend
  * Session status
    - new microservice to report SessionID status to IVXV services.
      This could help IVXV services to detect whether SessionID
      has been tampered or not.
  * BDOC
    - remove TM profiles support for backend as it is not anymore
      supported by digidoc-tool

